</person-group><article-title>Cigarette smoking, elevated fasting serum glucose, and risk of pancreatic cancer in Korean men</article-title><source>Int J Cancer</source><year>2006</year><volume>119</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>208</fpage><lpage>212</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/ijc.21816</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Yun JE, Jo I, Park J, Kim MT, Ryu HG, Odongua N et al (2006) Cigarette smoking, elevated fasting serum glucose, and risk of pancreatic cancer in Korean men. Int J Cancer 119(1):208&#x02013;212. doi:10.1002/ijc.21816 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16450398</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR8"><label>8.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Michaud</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Wolpin</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Giovannucci</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Cochrane</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Manson</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Prediagnostic plasma C-peptide and pancreatic cancer risk in men and women</article-title><source>Cancer Epidemiol Biomarkers Prev</source><year>2007</year><volume>16</volume><issue>10</issue><fpage>2101</fpage><lpage>2109</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1158/1055-9965.EPI-07-0182</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Michaud DS, Wolpin B, Giovannucci E, Liu S, Cochrane B, Manson JE et al (2007) Prediagnostic plasma C-peptide and pancreatic cancer risk in men and women. Cancer Epidemiol Biomarkers Prev 16(10):2101&#x02013;2109. doi:10.1158/1055-9965.EPI-07-0182 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17905943</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR9"><label>9.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hennig</surname><given-name